it: int = 10) -> Dict:\\nneuro-perf-analysis.md-16-    insights = {...}\\nneuro-perf-analysis.md-17-    \\nneuro-perf-analysis.md-18-    # SCANS ALL EPISODES EVERY QUERY - O(10,000) iterations\\n--\\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-325-    log.debug(\\\"[Evolution] Querying neuro-memory for insights...\\\");\\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-326-    \\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-327-    try {\\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts:328:      const result = await this.request(\\\"query_insights\\\", query || {});\\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-329-      \\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-330-      const duration = Date.now() - startTime;\\nopenclaw/src/agents/neuro-memory-bridge.ts-331-      log.info(\",\n  \"numLines\": 88\n}"}],"details":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"MEMORY.md-23-[Omitted long context line]\nMEMORY.md-24-[Omitted long context line]\nMEMORY.md-25-- 2026-03-08: **IMPLEMENTED** neuro-memory → evolution integration - Query interface + fallback logic + health checks + tests + documentation. Files created:\nMEMORY.md:26:[Omitted long matching line]\nMEMORY.md-27-\nMEMORY.md-28-- Status: Gateway RUNNING (PID 36802)\nMEMORY.md-29-- Predictive Engine: Initialized (5 rules loaded, 0 events)\n--\nMEMORY.md-33-- Build: Successful with warnings\nMEMORY.md-34-- Tests: Ready\nMEMORY.md-35-- Documentation: Created at `memory/2026-03-08-neuro-memory-evolution-integration.md`.\nMEMORY.md:36:- 2026-03-08: **IMPLEMENTED** neuro-memory → evolution integration - Evolution service queries neuro-memory for failure patterns, success patterns, and recent usage history before generating proposals. Files created: neuro-memory-bridge.ts (extended with queryInsights), evolution-service.ts (modified), neuro-memory-insights.ts (new). Python MCP server pending `query_insights` endpoint. Status: Gateway RUNNING (PID 40658). All systems operational. Next: Restart gateway to test integratio